    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d111">

                <pb facs="0166" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg82"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72114/3765</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stovall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-17T18:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 17, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2304. Your 3822, June 30, 12 a.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d111-f1"/> Request the
                    good offices of the Swiss Government in assisting in coming conference.
                    Ascertain <pb facs="0167" n="83" xml:id="pg83"/> whether Swiss Government will
                    nominate a Swiss national to preside and whether it will furnish a room in which
                    the conference may take place, adding that this Government would particularly
                    appreciate a favorable reply.</p>
                <p>Request Spanish Embassy in Berlin to inform German Government that this
                    Government considers it highly important that a definite date for the conference
                    be set as soon as possible, and that this Government is ready to extend the
                    proposed conference to include civilians so far as concerns the conditions
                    existing in civil internment camps.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
